主持台:
{
  "kind": "shelter-events",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "events": [{
    "name": "停电的售货机", "location": "地下通道", "tags": ["售货机"],
    "body": "正文……", "isDraft": true, "participants": "1～2人", "carryTicks": 2,
    "conditions": "", "itemUses": "", "modifiers": "",
    "options": [{ "label": "参与", "outcomes": [
      { "text": "得到两瓶水", "probability": 60,
        "effects": { "rescue": null, "pool": [{ "defId": "water", "qty": 2 }],
                     "personal": { "target": "参与者", "hp": -1, "items": [] } } }
    ] }]
  }]
}
（也可以直接导入事件数组。carryTicks 以半格计：2 = 1 单位。）

Console:
{
  "kind": "shelter-events",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "events": [{
    "name": "Dead vending machine", "location": "Underpass", "tags": ["vending"],
    "body": "Text…", "isDraft": true, "participants": "1–2 players", "carryTicks": 2,
    "conditions": "", "itemUses": "", "modifiers": "",
    "options": [{ "label": "Join", "outcomes": [
      { "text": "Get two bottles of water", "probability": 60,
        "effects": { "rescue": null, "pool": [{ "defId": "water", "qty": 2 }],
                     "personal": { "target": "participants", "hp": -1, "items": [] } } }
    ] }]
  }]
}
(You can also import a bare array of events. carryTicks counts half-units: 2 = 1 unit.)
